OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,FAndy Burnham will kick off a national
OL,7,Ftour in the coming week to ask the
OL,8,Fpublic how the government can improve
OL,9,Ftheir lives.
OL,11,FOfficials said the prime minister
OL,12,Fwould be in "listening mode" as he
OL,13,Fspends much of the rest of August
OL,14,Ftravelling the country to discuss the
OL,15,Fcost of living.
OL,17,FHaving promised to give the public
OL,18,F"breathing space", he is expected to
OL,19,Funveil a series of measures intended
OL,20,Fto help with bills.
OL,26,@tD@MOUtD@\O]zD@AOUzD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
