CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786353511
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,FIt comes after the PM cut VAT from
OL,7,Fenergy bills from October and
OL,8,Fannounced a #2 cap on bus fares across
OL,9,FEngland in his first week in Downing
OL,10,FStreet.
OL,12,FBurnham will also focus on improving
OL,13,Fhigh streets, using his summer tour to
OL,14,Finform his 10-year plan for the
OL,15,Fcountry, officials say.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the prime minister
OL,18,Fsaid he would be "getting out of
OL,19,FWestminster and meeting people where
OL,20,Fthey are".
OL,26,@zD@ROU|D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
