OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786353511
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,F"He thinks Westminster has got used to
OL,7,Ftelling people that everyday hassles `
OL,8,Flike hidden pricing and consumers
OL,9,Fbeing ripped off ` must be accepted as
OL,10,Fpart of life," they added.
OL,12,F"He doesn't think that's right. That's
OL,13,Fwhy he's going to start rolling out a
OL,14,Fseries of pro-consumer cost-of-living
OL,15,Fmeasures to give people some room to
OL,16,Fbreathe."
OL,18,FOpposition figures have accused
OL,19,FBurnham of "tinkering" with his
OL,20,Fannouncements and have suggested some
OL,21,Fof his policies are damaging to growth.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@NO]tD@AOUxD@IO]{D@LOU{D@VO]
