OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786353511
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,FShadow chancellor Sir Mel Stride
OL,7,Faccused Burnham of "breathtaking
OL,8,Fhypocrisy", arguing tax hikes and "red
OL,9,Ftape" were "hammering our high
OL,10,Fstreets", forcing businesses to close
OL,11,Fand driving up prices.
OL,13,FHe added: "Meanwhile Labour are
OL,14,Fplotting to release dangerous
OL,15,Fcriminals onto our streets, leaving
OL,16,Fpeople feeling unsafe in their
OL,17,Fcommunities.
OL,26,@oD@TOUpD@JO]pD@cOUqD@EO]qD@LOUrD@HO]uD@
OL,26,AKOU
