FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,F"If Burnham is really serious about
OL,7,Fcutting the cost of living, he should
OL,8,Fadopt our plan for stronger high
OL,9,Fstreets ` including scrapping business
OL,10,Frates for thousands of high street
OL,11,Ffirms.
OL,13,F"And if he wants people to feel proud
OL,14,Fof the places where they live, he
OL,15,Fshould scrap his disastrous plans to
OL,16,Flet vile criminals walk free."
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
