OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,FLib Dem Treasury spokeswoman Daisy
OL,7,FCooper said: "Struggling high street
OL,8,Fbusinesses have been pushed to the
OL,9,Fbrink by Labour's tax hikes and
OL,10,Funnecessary new red tape.
OL,12,F"They need more than a new PM
OL,13,Fembarking on a vanity tour this summer.
OL,15,F"If the Prime Minister is serious
OL,16,Fabout revitalising our town centres,
OL,17,Fhe should immediately adopt the
OL,18,FLiberal Democrats' plan to breathe
OL,19,Flife back into our high streets.
OL,26,@oD@NOUtD@AOUwD@AOU
