OL,3,CAndy Burnham to go on national tour to
OL,4,Chear cost of living concerns
OL,6,F"That means reversing the damaging
OL,7,Fjobs tax, delivering an emergency VAT
OL,8,Fcut for hospitality, replacing broken
OL,9,Fbusiness rates and cracking down on
OL,10,Fthe ghost landlords leaving our
OL,11,Fshopfronts vacant."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@SO]
